  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small and Medium sized Enterprises Finance Facility (SMEFF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The facility will ensure both financial and value additionality, particularly by i. providing finance that is not provided by the market ii. Mobilizing resource from the private sector and adding value beyond providing financial support by mitigating risks, helping SMEs achieve higher standards (i.e., on gender practices, sustainable business practices, ESG performance) or building capacity or transferring knowledge and know how.</narrative>
  </description>
